<title>USA: Mobil to lift 600,000 bbls/mth Iraqi crude.</title>
<headline>Mobil to lift 600,000 bbls/mth Iraqi crude.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mobil Corp said Friday that it has signed a contract with Iraq to lift 600,000 barrels a moght of Basra Light crude oil from the Gulf port of Mina-al-Bakr.</p>
<p>Mobil has already been given a contract by the U.S. Treasury's Office of Foreign Assets Control and is awaiting final approval from the United Nations overseers, a company spokesman said.</p>
</text>
